  "observed": [
    "Ran ordinary first-use startup, chose Not now for sign-in and continued without downloading models.",
    "Opened a real New Tab with the shell plus button, selected Customise and clicked Add shortcut. Focus was in Find an app, the profile default pins displayed checks, and remaining current apps displayed add affordances.",
    "At 1440×900 the real picker used three columns. Resizing to 720×520 kept focus, presented two scrollable columns and left the full dialog reachable. The Atlas compact capture crops the same 1440 CSS canvas.",
    "Entered Boards by keyboard. Tab focused the only filtered registered candidate; Enter added it, displayed the checked candidate and receipt, and refocused the search field.",
    "Custom address opened the blank form. Cancel returned to the filtered picker and focused Custom address. Escape dismissed the picker and returned to the underlying Add shortcut. The layout did not change.",
    "After ordinary close and restart, the projected Boards pin retained its registered identity and canonical target. Clicking the tile opened Your boards, and clicking the native address exposed 9to1://boards.",
    "A separate New Tab Customise Accent click opened the actual dedicated Accent palette and exposed Off / On / On per app and four presets. Back to appearance returned to the gallery and focused Theme. The source New Tab still had Customise open."
  ],
